# Behold the Sinister Six! {6}{B}: "Return up to six target creature cards with different names from your graveyard to the battlefield"
# (CR 115.1, 201.2b). Two Wheels of Fortune put seven differently named creature cards in Bot1's graveyard (Ornithopter, Glistener Elf,
# Benalish Hero, Mesa Pegasus, Hired Blade, Memnite, Healer's Hawk). All seven at once are refused (the limit is six), the six
# are accepted and return together, and the seventh stays in the graveyard.
# Six moxes and a Swamp pay the seven mana on turn 3.

